WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.192
A first draft arranges a topic sentence and supporting points in a logical order.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:10.471
Why make a plan before writing? Answer: To organise ideas logically.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:14.825
Write a six-sentence paragraph draft about a healthy school lunch.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.025
Discuss why: Planning guides the draft.
